0.17.0
- standalone flycast
  home     -> select
  d-pad    -> direction
  b + plus -> disable/enable ir (useful in gui)
  lightgun mode in game:
    1    -> start
    2    -> back
    b    -> trigger
- new map:
    a + home -> menu retroarch
    b + home -> menu mame, flycast
    b + plus -> disable/enable ir (useful in gui)
    home -> KEY_ENTER
